third_party/vsvig/VSViG.py and third_party/vsvig/dy_point_order.pt
  From VSViG, https://github.com/xuyankun/VSViG
  Yankun Xu, Junzhe Wang, Yun-Hsuan Chen, Jie Yang, Wenjie Ming, Shuang Wang and Mohamad Sawan,
  "VSViG: Real-Time Video-Based Seizure Detection via Skeleton-Based Spatiotemporal ViG", ECCV 2024.
